{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're late for a meeting, and the entire city seems designed to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Good Luck</strong> is a third-person, physics-based rage platformer where you walk through a city filled with unexpected traps, absurd dangers, and no second chances. One mistake? You're back at the start.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>What to expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Surprising obstacles like exploding trash bins, falling streetlights, slippery banana peels, and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenge that tests your patience with\u00a0zero checkpoints. No mercy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stylized  visuals and slapstick physics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Co-op mode coming soon \u2014 fail together with friends</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Just get to your meeting.  <br>That\u2019s it, just walk.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sounds easy, right?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>One small mistake? Back to the start. No Mercy!</strong>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/gif_slide.gif?t=1744916960\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Learn by failing\u2014again and again!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/gif_die.gif?t=1744916960\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>There's One Simple Goal: Survive!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/explode.gif?t=1744916960\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Co-op Mode Coming Soon!</strong>  <br>Because suffering with friends is just better.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Are you patient enough?  <br>Are you stubborn enough?  <br>Let\u2019s find out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Good Luck.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/TEXT.png?t=1744916960\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Epilepsy warning: contains some surprising elements.</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657240?t=1744916960","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3657240?t=1744916960","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/2912c8707c77d5bc45cc3f6550f26b60dab4f96f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744916960","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/2912c8707c77d5bc45cc3f6550f26b60dab4f96f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744916960","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3667930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>DON'T FORGET TO WHISTLIST!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3657240/extras/addtowishlist_gif__1_.gif?t=1744916960\" /></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're late for a meeting, and the entire city seems designed to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Good Luck</strong> is a third-person, physics-based rage platformer where you walk through a city filled with unexpected traps, absurd dangers, and no second chances. One mistak